    <div id="privacyModal" class="privacy-modal" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="privacy-modal-box">
            <button type="button" class="privacy-modal-close" aria-label="Close">&times;</button>
            <div class="privacy-modal-scroll" data-lenis-prevent>
                <h3>Privacy Policy</h3>
                <p class="pp-effective">Effective Date: July 2025 &nbsp;|&nbsp; Mint Marketing India</p>
                <p>Welcome to Mint Marketing India ("Mint Marketing," "we," "our," or "us"). We value your privacy and are committed to protecting the personal information you share with us. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your information when you visit our website or interact with our services.</p>

                <h4>1. Information We Collect</h4>
                <p><strong>Personal Information</strong><br>When you contact us, request a consultation, or fill out any forms on our website, we may collect: Full Name, Email Address, Phone Number, Company Name, Website URL, and any additional information you voluntarily provide.</p>
                <p><strong>Non-Personal Information</strong><br>We may automatically collect: IP Address, browser type and version, device information, pages visited, time spent on our website, referral source, and cookies and analytics data.</p>

                <h4>2. How We Use Your Information</h4>
                <p>We use your information to respond to inquiries and provide customer support; deliver our digital marketing services; improve our website and user experience; send proposals, quotations, or requested information; share updates about our services (only where permitted); analyse website performance and visitor behaviour; and prevent fraud and maintain website security.</p>

                <h4>3. Cookies</h4>
                <p>Our website may use cookies and similar technologies to improve your browsing experience and analyse website traffic. You can disable cookies through your browser settings, although some website features may not function properly.</p>

                <h4>4. Third-Party Services</h4>
                <p>We may use trusted third-party services such as Google Analytics, Google Ads, Meta (Facebook &amp; Instagram) Advertising Tools, LinkedIn Advertising, Email Marketing Platforms, and CRM and Lead Management Software. These providers may collect information in accordance with their own privacy policies.</p>

                <h4>5. Information Sharing</h4>
                <p>We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information. We may share your information only with trusted service providers assisting in business operations; when required by law or legal process; to protect our legal rights or prevent fraud; or during a business transfer, merger, or acquisition.</p>

                <h4>6. Data Security</h4>
                <p>We implement reasonable administrative, technical, and organisational security measures to protect your personal information from unauthorised access, disclosure, alteration, or destruction. However, no method of internet transmission or electronic storage is completely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>

                <h4>7. Data Retention</h4>
                <p>We retain your personal information only for as long as necessary to fulfil the purposes described in this Privacy Policy or as required by applicable law.</p>

                <h4>8. Your Rights</h4>
                <p>Depending on applicable laws, you may have the right to request access to your personal information; request correction of inaccurate information; request deletion of your personal information; withdraw consent where applicable; and opt out of receiving marketing communications. To exercise these rights, please contact us using the details below.</p>

                <h4>9. External Links</h4>
                <p>Our website may contain links to third-party websites. We are not responsible for the privacy practices or content of those websites.</p>

                <h4>10. Children's Privacy</h4>
                <p>Our website and services are not intended for individuals under the age of 18. We do not knowingly collect personal information from minors.</p>

                <h4>11. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h4>
                <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated Effective Date.</p>

                <h4>12. Contact Us</h4>
                <p>If you have any questions regarding this Privacy Policy or how we handle your information, please contact us:<br>
                <strong>Mint Marketing India</strong><br>
                Email: <a href="mailto:workwithmintmarketing@gmail.com">workwithmintmarketing@gmail.com</a></p>
            </div>
